{"id":"3dc0a535eb69e742","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-trapdoor-permutation.md","title":"Trapdoor Permutation","display":"df-trapdoor-permutation — Trapdoor Permutation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-trapdoor-permutation","aliases":["28-df-trapdoor-permutation","Trapdoor Permutation"],"display":"df-trapdoor-permutation — Trapdoor Permutation","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-negl]]"],"source_book_location":"§9.2.1 trapdoor functions discussion; printed pp.177–178; PDF pp.203–204","source_printed_pages":"177–178","source_pdf_pages":"203–204","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-trapdoor-permutation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-trapdoor-permutation</span><span>Trapdoor Permutation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-trapdoor-permutation — Trapdoor Permutation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§9.2.1 trapdoor functions discussion; printed pp.177–178; PDF pp.203–204"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"177–178"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"203–204"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp},F,I,(D_{n,pk})_{n,pk})\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp},F,I,(D_{n,pk})_{n,pk})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,I\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(F,I\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle pk,sk\\rangle=1^{|pk|}0pk\\,sk\">\\(\\langle pk,sk\\rangle=1^{|pk|}0pk\\,sk\\)</span> 是字符串配对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)\\)</span> 的支撑包含于这些配对字串的集合；其解码后的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n\\)</span> 与有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_n\">\\(\\mathcal K_n\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(pk,sk)\\in\\mathcal K_n\">\\((pk,sk)\\in\\mathcal K_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{n,pk}\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(D_{n,pk}\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为给定的有限非空域，域成员关系可由同一个确定型算法在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1^n,pk,x)\">\\((1^n,pk,x)\\)</span> 上判定；域元素及密钥的长度以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的同一个多项式有界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Samp}(1^n,pk)\">\\(\\operatorname{Samp}(1^n,pk)\\)</span> 是域采样算法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{n,pk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}\">\\(F_{n,pk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{n,sk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}\">\\(I_{n,sk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(1^n,pk,\\cdot)\">\\(F(1^n,pk,\\cdot)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(1^n,sk,\\cdot)\">\\(I(1^n,sk,\\cdot)\\)</span>。算法均显式接收 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span>，多输入使用固定配对编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{D_{n,pk}}\">\\(U_{D_{n,pk}}\\)</span> 为域上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TDP}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\operatorname{TDP}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 为陷门置换族谓词。密钥先按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n\\)</span> 抽样，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 条件于得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pk\">\\(pk\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{D_{n,pk}}\">\\(U_{D_{n,pk}}\\)</span> 抽样；求逆器使用独立随机性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)\\coloneqq\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)=\\langle pk,sk\\rangle]\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)\\coloneqq\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)=\\langle pk,sk\\rangle]\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_n\\coloneqq\\{(pk,sk)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*: \\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)&gt;0\\},\\qquad\\sum_{pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*}\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_n\\coloneqq\\{(pk,sk)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*: \\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)&gt;0\\},\\qquad\\sum_{pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*}\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TDP}(\\mathcal F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(pk,sk)\\in\\mathcal K_n\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Samp}(1^n,pk)=U_{D_{n,pk}}\\land\\left[\\forall y\\in D_{n,pk}\\;\\exists!x\\in D_{n,pk}\\;F_{n,pk}(x)=y\\right]\\land\\forall x\\in D_{n,pk}\\;I_{n,sk}(F_{n,pk}(x))=x\\right)\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\Pr_{(pk,sk)\\leftarrow\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n,\\;x\\leftarrow U_{D_{n,pk}}}[A(1^n,pk,F_{n,pk}(x))=x]\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TDP}(\\mathcal F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(pk,sk)\\in\\mathcal K_n\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Samp}(1^n,pk)=U_{D_{n,pk}}\\land\\left[\\forall y\\in D_{n,pk}\\;\\exists!x\\in D_{n,pk}\\;F_{n,pk}(x)=y\\right]\\land\\forall x\\in D_{n,pk}\\;I_{n,sk}(F_{n,pk}(x))=x\\right)\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\Pr_{(pk,sk)\\leftarrow\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n,\\;x\\leftarrow U_{D_{n,pk}}}[A(1^n,pk,F_{n,pk}(x))=x]\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§9.2.1 讨论 RSA、Rabin 等陷门单向函数，此处给出抽象密钥生成及域采样接口。精确均匀采样是本节点所采用模型的额外要求；若仅有期望时间或统计近似采样，应另改采样条件并重新核对结论。原稿的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(pk,sk),x\\in D_{pk}\">\\((pk,sk),x\\in D_{pk}\\)</span> 错误绑域及 Remark 中才出现的概率来源均已修复。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathcal F=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp},F,I,(D_{n,pk})_{n,pk})$；$\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$，$F,I\\in\\mathbf{FP}$，见 [[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathcal F=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp},F,I,(D_{n,pk})_{n,pk})$；$\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$，$F,I\\in\\mathbf{FP}$，见 [[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Samp}(1^n,pk)$ 是域采样算法；$F_{n,pk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}$、$I_{n,sk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}$ 分别缩写 $F(1^n,pk,\\cdot)$、$I(1^n,sk,\\cdot)$。算法均显式接收 $1^n$，多输入使用固定配对编码。$U_{D_{n,pk}}$ 为域上的均匀分布，$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp},F,I,(D_{n,pk})_{n,pk})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Samp}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"F,I\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle pk,sk\\rangle=1^{|pk|}0pk\\,sk","display":false},{"tex":"pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_n","display":false},{"tex":"(pk,sk)\\in\\mathcal K_n","display":false},{"tex":"D_{n,pk}\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"(1^n,pk,x)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Samp}(1^n,pk)","display":false},{"tex":"F_{n,pk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{n,sk}:D_{n,pk}\\to D_{n,pk}","display":false},{"tex":"F(1^n,pk,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"I(1^n,sk,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"1^n","display":false},{"tex":"U_{D_{n,pk}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TDP}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"pk","display":false},{"tex":"U_{D_{n,pk}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)\\coloneqq\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)=\\langle pk,sk\\rangle]\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_n\\coloneqq\\{(pk,sk)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*: \\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)>0\\},\\qquad\\sum_{pk,sk\\in\\Sigma^*}\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n(pk,sk)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TDP}(\\mathcal F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(pk,sk)\\in\\mathcal K_n\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Samp}(1^n,pk)=U_{D_{n,pk}}\\land\\left[\\forall y\\in D_{n,pk}\\;\\exists!x\\in D_{n,pk}\\;F_{n,pk}(x)=y\\right]\\land\\forall x\\in D_{n,pk}\\;I_{n,sk}(F_{n,pk}(x))=x\\right)\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\Pr_{(pk,sk)\\leftarrow\\operatorname{KeyDist}_n,\\;x\\leftarrow U_{D_{n,pk}}}[A(1^n,pk,F_{n,pk}(x))=x]\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"(pk,sk),x\\in D_{pk}","display":false}],"bytes":3069,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"密码方案：[[28-df-symmetric-encryption]]、[[28-df-ind-cpa]]、[[28-df-trapdoor-permutation]]、[[28-df-digital-signature]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf","adb92775ec020a0b","f3171800627deef3"]}